{"id":"f49962f64360a930","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-dyn-fo.md","title":"一阶初始化与同步更新的 DynFO","display":"df-dyn-fo — 一阶初始化与同步更新的 DynFO","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-dyn-fo","aliases":["29-df-dyn-fo"],"display":"df-dyn-fo — 一阶初始化与同步更新的 DynFO","depends_on":["[[29-df-dynamic-update]]","[[29-df-formula]]","[[29-df-free-variable]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]","[[29-df-variable]]","[[29-df-assignment]]","[[29-df-vocab]]"],"source_locator":"Definition14.18, pp.228–229, scans243–244","source_basis":"扫描244原图及文本层；给出固定论域关系片段，辅助量多项式界和历史承诺显式化","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(2).zip修订；既有原书定位、日期和过往核对叙述作为继承记录，未重新取得或查看原书原件","revision_verification":"声明、类型、绑定、递归及书内链接审查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-dyn-fo"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-dyn-fo</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dyn-fo — 一阶初始化与同步更新的 DynFO"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"106187bc180d14ba\" href=\"?note=106187bc180d14ba\" title=\"29-df-dynamic-update\">29-df-dynamic-update</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" href=\"?note=a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" title=\"29-df-formula\">29-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"db2b32546860e623\" href=\"?note=db2b32546860e623\" title=\"29-df-free-variable\">29-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ad08b66c5e54a436\" href=\"?note=ad08b66c5e54a436\" title=\"29-df-variable\">29-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ac5c4072279f0088\" href=\"?note=ac5c4072279f0088\" title=\"29-df-assignment\">29-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition14.18, pp.228–229, scans243–244"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"扫描244原图及文本层；给出固定论域关系片段，辅助量多项式界和历史承诺显式化"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(2).zip修订；既有原书定位、日期和过往核对叙述作为继承记录，未重新取得或查看原书原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"声明、类型、绑定、递归及书内链接审查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>输入词汇 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>、标准域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_n\">\\(U_n\\)</span>、标准输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_\\tau\">\\(\\mathcal A_\\tau\\)</span>、初态和历史见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"106187bc180d14ba\" href=\"?note=106187bc180d14ba\" title=\"29-df-dynamic-update\">29-df-dynamic-update</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\in\\mathsf{Hist}_\\tau\">\\(H\\in\\mathsf{Hist}_\\tau\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathcal A_\\tau\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathcal A_\\tau\\)</span> 是元语言布尔性质。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda=\\tau\\cup\\{\\leq\\}\">\\(\\lambda=\\tau\\cup\\{\\leq\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho=\\langle B_1^{(b_1)},\\ldots,B_m^{(b_m)}\\rangle\">\\(\\rho=\\langle B_1^{(b_1)},\\ldots,B_m^{(b_m)}\\rangle\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 不交，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,b_j\\geq1\">\\(m,b_j\\geq1\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar y_j\">\\(\\bar y_j\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_j\">\\(b_j\\)</span> 个不同变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar z_i\">\\(\\bar z_i\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_i\">\\(a_i\\)</span> 个不同请求参数变量，且两组互不相交。</li>\n<li>初始化公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_j\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\operatorname{vocab}(\\{\\leq\\})}\">\\(\\eta_j\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\operatorname{vocab}(\\{\\leq\\})}\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(\\eta_j)\\subseteq\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar y_j)\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}(\\eta_j)\\subseteq\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar y_j)\\)</span>；每个操作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o\\in\\{\\mathsf{ins},\\mathsf{del}\\}\">\\(o\\in\\{\\mathsf{ins},\\mathsf{del}\\}\\)</span>、输入关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span>、辅助关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 有固定公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_{o,i,j}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\lambda\\cup\\rho}\">\\(\\delta_{o,i,j}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\lambda\\cup\\rho}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(\\delta_{o,i,j})\\subseteq(\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar y_j)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar z_i))\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}(\\delta_{o,i,j})\\subseteq(\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar y_j)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar z_i))\\)</span>。读出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\lambda\\cup\\rho}\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\lambda\\cup\\rho}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(\\theta)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}(\\theta)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi=(\\rho,(\\bar y_j)_j,(\\bar z_i)_i,(\\eta_j)_j,(\\delta_{o,i,j})_{o,i,j},\\theta)\">\\(\\Pi=(\\rho,(\\bar y_j)_j,(\\bar z_i)_i,(\\eta_j)_j,(\\delta_{o,i,j})_{o,i,j},\\theta)\\)</span> 为待检验的有限元组；所有公式固定，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 或历史。下式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ProgFO}_\\tau\">\\(\\mathsf{ProgFO}_\\tau\\)</span> 收集满足语法条件的元组。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_n=(U_n,\\leq_n)\">\\(N_n=(U_n,\\leq_n)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[\\rho:=\\mathbf X]\">\\(A[\\rho:=\\mathbf X]\\)</span> 保留输入结构全部解释并增加辅助关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h=(r_1,\\ldots,r_l)\\in H_n\">\\(h=(r_1,\\ldots,r_l)\\in H_n\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_t^{\\Pi,n,h}\">\\(B_t^{\\Pi,n,h}\\)</span> 是完整输入及辅助状态。更新公式均在旧 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_t\">\\(B_t\\)</span> 上求值。单块与多块局部赋值取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ac5c4072279f0088\" href=\"?note=ac5c4072279f0088\" title=\"29-df-assignment\">29-df-assignment</a>，其满足关系取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a>；每次调用都满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\alpha)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 是所显示的局部赋值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ProgFO}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(\\rho,(\\bar y_j)_j,(\\bar z_i)_i,(\\eta_j)_j,(\\delta_{o,i,j})_{o,i,j},\\theta\\right)\\ \\middle|\\ \\begin{aligned}&amp;m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1},\\quad(b_1,\\ldots,b_m)\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}^m,\\quad\\rho=\\langle B_1^{(b_1)},\\ldots,B_m^{(b_m)}\\rangle,\\\\&amp;|\\{B_1,\\ldots,B_m\\}|=m,\\quad\\{B_1,\\ldots,B_m\\}\\cap\\lambda=\\varnothing,\\\\&amp;\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\;(\\bar y_j\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{b_j}\\land|\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar y_j)|=b_j\\land\\eta_j\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\operatorname{vocab}(\\{\\leq\\})}\\land\\mathrm{FV}(\\eta_j)\\subseteq\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar y_j)),\\\\&amp;\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\;(\\bar z_i\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{a_i}\\land|\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar z_i)|=a_i),\\\\&amp;\\forall o\\in\\{\\mathsf{ins},\\mathsf{del}\\}\\;\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\;\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\\\&amp;\\quad(\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar y_j)\\cap\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar z_i)=\\varnothing\\land\\delta_{o,i,j}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\lambda\\cup\\rho}\\land\\mathrm{FV}(\\delta_{o,i,j})\\subseteq(\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar y_j)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar z_i))),\\\\&amp;\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\lambda\\cup\\rho},\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(\\theta)=\\varnothing\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{ProgFO}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(\\rho,(\\bar y_j)_j,(\\bar z_i)_i,(\\eta_j)_j,(\\delta_{o,i,j})_{o,i,j},\\theta\\right)\\ \\middle|\\ \\begin{aligned}&amp;m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1},\\quad(b_1,\\ldots,b_m)\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}^m,\\quad\\rho=\\langle B_1^{(b_1)},\\ldots,B_m^{(b_m)}\\rangle,\\\\&amp;|\\{B_1,\\ldots,B_m\\}|=m,\\quad\\{B_1,\\ldots,B_m\\}\\cap\\lambda=\\varnothing,\\\\&amp;\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\;(\\bar y_j\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{b_j}\\land|\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar y_j)|=b_j\\land\\eta_j\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\operatorname{vocab}(\\{\\leq\\})}\\land\\mathrm{FV}(\\eta_j)\\subseteq\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar y_j)),\\\\&amp;\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\;(\\bar z_i\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{a_i}\\land|\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar z_i)|=a_i),\\\\&amp;\\forall o\\in\\{\\mathsf{ins},\\mathsf{del}\\}\\;\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\;\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\\\&amp;\\quad(\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar y_j)\\cap\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar z_i)=\\varnothing\\land\\delta_{o,i,j}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\lambda\\cup\\rho}\\land\\mathrm{FV}(\\delta_{o,i,j})\\subseteq(\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar y_j)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar z_i))),\\\\&amp;\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\lambda\\cup\\rho},\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(\\theta)=\\varnothing\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi\\in\\mathsf{ProgFO}_\\tau\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ X_{0,j}^{\\Pi,n,h}\\coloneqq\\{\\bar a\\in U_n^{b_j}\\mid N_n\\models\\eta_j[\\bar a/\\bar y_j]\\},\\qquad B_0^{\\Pi,n,h}\\coloneqq A_0^{n,h}[\\rho:=(X_{0,j}^{\\Pi,n,h})_{j=1}^m].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi\\in\\mathsf{ProgFO}_\\tau\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ X_{0,j}^{\\Pi,n,h}\\coloneqq\\{\\bar a\\in U_n^{b_j}\\mid N_n\\models\\eta_j[\\bar a/\\bar y_j]\\},\\qquad B_0^{\\Pi,n,h}\\coloneqq A_0^{n,h}[\\rho:=(X_{0,j}^{\\Pi,n,h})_{j=1}^m].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"r_{t+1}=(o,i,\\bar a)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\begin{aligned}X_{t+1,j}^{\\Pi,n,h}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\bar b\\in U_n^{b_j}\\mid B_t^{\\Pi,n,h}\\models\\delta_{o,i,j}[\\bar b,\\bar a/\\bar y_j,\\bar z_i]\\},\\\\B_{t+1}^{\\Pi,n,h}&amp;\\coloneqq A_{t+1}^{n,h}[\\rho:=(X_{t+1,j}^{\\Pi,n,h})_{j=1}^m],\\qquad 0\\leq t&lt;|h|.\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[r_{t+1}=(o,i,\\bar a)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\begin{aligned}X_{t+1,j}^{\\Pi,n,h}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\bar b\\in U_n^{b_j}\\mid B_t^{\\Pi,n,h}\\models\\delta_{o,i,j}[\\bar b,\\bar a/\\bar y_j,\\bar z_i]\\},\\\\B_{t+1}^{\\Pi,n,h}&amp;\\coloneqq A_{t+1}^{n,h}[\\rho:=(X_{t+1,j}^{\\Pi,n,h})_{j=1}^m],\\qquad 0\\leq t&lt;|h|.\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MaintFO}_\\tau(\\Pi,Q,H)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\Pi\\in\\mathsf{ProgFO}_\\tau\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall h\\in H_n\\;\\forall t\\leq|h|\\;(A_t^{n,h}\\in Q\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ B_t^{\\Pi,n,h}\\models\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MaintFO}_\\tau(\\Pi,Q,H)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\Pi\\in\\mathsf{ProgFO}_\\tau\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall h\\in H_n\\;\\forall t\\leq|h|\\;(A_t^{n,h}\\in Q\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ B_t^{\\Pi,n,h}\\models\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DynFO}_\\tau[H]\\coloneqq\\{Q\\subseteq\\mathcal A_\\tau\\mid\\exists\\Pi\\in\\mathsf{ProgFO}_\\tau\\;\\operatorname{MaintFO}_\\tau(\\Pi,Q,H)\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{DynFO}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\operatorname{DynFO}_\\tau[H^{\\rm all}_\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{DynFO}_\\tau[H]\\coloneqq\\{Q\\subseteq\\mathcal A_\\tau\\mid\\exists\\Pi\\in\\mathsf{ProgFO}_\\tau\\;\\operatorname{MaintFO}_\\tau(\\Pi,Q,H)\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{DynFO}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\operatorname{DynFO}_\\tau[H^{\\rm all}_\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{j=1}^m|X_{t,j}^{\\Pi,n,h}|\\leq\\sum_{j=1}^m n^{b_j}\\leq m n^{\\max_j b_j}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sum_{j=1}^m|X_{t,j}^{\\Pi,n,h}|\\leq\\sum_{j=1}^m n^{b_j}\\leq m n^{\\max_j b_j}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition14.18 用初始化映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>、单步映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 和布尔测试 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 定义 Dyn-C，并要求辅助表示至多多项式大小。本条将 Dyn-FO 的固定论域关系实现全部展开：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 为一阶初始化公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 为带当前请求参数的同步一阶更新，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 为一阶读出。有限个固定元数的辅助关系给出最后的多项式界。没有把“任意预计算”混入初始化，也没有宣称本片段已经涵盖可变载体或原书全部常量更新。</p>\n<p>布尔辅助位可用始终全空或全满的一元关系表示，从而在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=1\">\\(n=1\\)</span> 时也有两个状态，无需增加零元关系或要求域中存在两个不同元素。历史承诺参数必须出现在类签名中；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DynFO}_\\tau\">\\(\\operatorname{DynFO}_\\tau\\)</span> 默认要求所有插入/删除序列。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-dynamic-update","status":"resolved","id":"106187bc180d14ba","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-dynamic-update]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a3fa1d78e657e6a2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"db2b32546860e623","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"ad08b66c5e54a436","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"ac5c4072279f0088","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-dynamic-update","status":"resolved","id":"106187bc180d14ba","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"输入词汇 $\\tau$、标准域 $U_n$、标准输入 $\\mathcal A_\\tau$、初态和历史见 [[29-df-dynamic-update]]。$H\\in\\mathsf{Hist}_\\tau$；$Q\\subseteq\\mathcal A_\\tau$ 是元语言布尔性质。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"ac5c4072279f0088","anchor":"ref-9